{"id":"06765da425264baa","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-connected-geometric-morphism.md","title":"Definition — 连通几何态射","display":"Definition — 连通几何态射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism","aliases":["14-df-connected-geometric-morphism"],"display":"Definition — 连通几何态射","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-connected-geometric-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-connected-geometric-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 连通几何态射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*(A),f^*(B))\\ \\exists!k\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ (f^*(k)=h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*(A),f^*(B))\\ \\exists!k\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ (f^*(k)=h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VII 的连通态射条件是逆像全忠实。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsConnected}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*(A),f^*(B))\\ \\exists!k\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ (f^*(k)=h).","display":true}],"bytes":781,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism|Definition — 连通几何态射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism|Definition — 连通几何态射]]"},{"id":"a0c4bf7fbcc14304","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"连通与满射见 [[14-df-connected-geometric-morphism]]、[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]。"},{"id":"8dd39e9fd83ff83f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9752b